00:14:43,660 --> 00:14:44,360
That's good!

275
00:14:44,760 --> 00:14:48,740
I'm sure our neighbors saw my husband and his mother as kind, charitable people

276
00:14:48,740 --> 00:14:52,000
But behind closed doors, they still mocked me

277
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:54,900
They looked down on me

278
00:14:54,900 --> 00:14:56,920
Just like everyone else

279
00:14:56,920 --> 00:14:59,380
Those two didn't accept me at all

280
00:14:59,380 --> 00:15:01,480
They were only using me

281
00:15:01,480 --> 00:15:05,440
They enjoyed treating me like trash

282
00:15:05,440 --> 00:15:09,920
It was the one thing that made them feel better about their own pathetic lives

283
00:15:09,920 --> 00:15:12,200
I'm happy they're dead

284
00:15:12,200 --> 00:15:14,680
They deserved what happened to them

285
00:15:14,680 --> 00:15:17,000
Dasu

286
00:15:17,000 --> 00:15:20,240
I'm sorry, I just...

287
00:15:20,240 --> 00:15:23,320
The details of the situation may vary from person to person

288
00:15:23,320 --> 00:15:26,200
But everyone in our group has had a similar experience

289
00:15:26,200 --> 00:15:28,860
All of you feel like that?

290
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:30,200
Yes

291
00:15:30,200 --> 00:15:35,980
I'm able to create medicines and potions that are far more effective than the magic of an average recovery mage

292
00:15:35,980 --> 00:15:37,780
So my skills are quite valuable

293
00:15:37,780 --> 00:15:41,420
Despite that, I was still shunned for my lack of mana

294
00:15:41,420 --> 00:15:44,260
Occasionally, people would rely on my expertise

295
00:15:44,260 --> 00:15:49,100
But once my usefulness had run its course, they wanted nothing more to do with me

296
00:15:49,100 --> 00:15:51,260
That's what happened to me too

297
00:15:51,260 --> 00:15:55,720
I spent countless nights poring over my books while my peers were out having fun

298
00:15:55,720 --> 00:15:58,020
I always had to work so hard

299
00:15:58,020 --> 00:16:00,520
So did I

300
00:16:00,520 --> 00:16:02,460
Me too

301
00:16:02,460 --> 00:16:05,940
We all did

302
00:16:05,940 --> 00:16:10,340
Everyone made fun of us because we couldn't use magic

303
00:16:10,340 --> 00:16:13,000
Sometimes it felt like we didn't even exist

304
00:16:13,000 --> 00:16:14,460
But that's over now

305
00:16:14,460 --> 00:16:16,960
We're leaving this awful place

306
00:16:16,960 --> 00:16:19,340
Look at these poor souls

307
00:16:19,340 --> 00:16:24,300
We met them on our way to the Spade Kingdom and realized they had suffered the same terrible things

308
00:16:24,300 --> 00:16:26,580
But they lived in the shadows

309
00:16:26,580 --> 00:16:28,840
So we never would have known about them

310
00:16:28,840 --> 00:16:34,020
I had no idea this many residents of the Clover Kingdom were dealing with such discontent

311
00:16:34,020 --> 00:16:38,100
To think that all these people understood our pain and wanted to help us

312
00:16:38,100 --> 00:16:39,940
And you

313
00:16:39,940 --> 00:16:43,080
How dare you tell us to go back now?

314
00:16:43,580 --> 00:16:46,320
You would have us return to that miserable existence?

315
00:16:47,020 --> 00:16:48,000
We've had enough

316
00:16:48,000 --> 00:16:51,000
You of all people should understand

317
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:53,260
Trust me, I get it

318
00:16:53,260 --> 00:16:53,860
Asta

319
00:16:53,860 --> 00:16:56,300
I know how much it sucks

320
00:16:56,300 --> 00:16:58,940
That's exactly why I have to stop you

321
00:16:58,940 --> 00:17:03,380
What is it about the Spade Kingdom that makes you so desperate to fight alongside them?

322
00:17:04,320 --> 00:17:06,560
We want to gain the Devil's power

323
00:17:06,560 --> 00:17:08,140
You're kidding!

324
00:17:08,140 --> 00:17:13,540
Cobway from the Magic Parliament told us there was a Devil in the Spade Kingdom

325
00:17:13,540 --> 00:17:15,220
We thought if we went there

326
00:17:15,220 --> 00:17:18,600
The strength of that great being might be shared with us

327
00:17:18,600 --> 00:17:22,060
I crave power

328
00:17:22,060 --> 00:17:24,180
All of our people do

329
00:17:24,180 --> 00:17:29,160
After aligning with the Spade Kingdom and receiving the Devil's overwhelming might

330
00:17:29,160 --> 00:17:31,040
We'll return to Clover

331
00:17:31,040 --> 00:17:33,040
And seek revenge

332
00:17:33,040 --> 00:17:33,920
Come on

333
00:17:33,920 --> 00:17:35,280
Don't do this

334
00:17:35,280 --> 00:17:40,840
The three Leaves of a Clover are said to contain integrity, hope, and love

335
00:17:40,840 --> 00:17:43,900
The fourth Leaf is given over to good luck

336
00:17:43,900 --> 00:17:46,320
And in the fifth Leaf dwells a Devil

337
00:17:46,320 --> 00:17:48,640
Isn't that how the saying goes?

338
00:17:48,700 --> 00:17:49,220
That's right

339
00:17:49,220 --> 00:17:53,380
Even though you had no mana and couldn't use magic

340
00:17:53,380 --> 00:17:57,040
You still gained the Devil's blessing because you had this grimoire

341
00:17:57,040 --> 00:18:01,180
You joined the Magic Knights and accomplished great things

342
00:18:01,180 --> 00:18:03,820
You have no idea how much we admire you

343
00:18:03,820 --> 00:18:05,020
Don't admire me

344
00:18:05,020 --> 00:18:06,220
Not for that

345
00:18:06,220 --> 00:18:08,800
We want to become like you

346
00:18:08,800 --> 00:18:11,380
That's why we're going to Spade

347
00:18:11,380 --> 00:18:14,300
Once we have the Devil's power, we can be reborn

348
00:18:14,300 --> 00:18:16,640
And then our suffering will be avenged

349
00:18:16,640 --> 00:18:19,740
That is our only objective

350
00:18:19,740 --> 00:18:21,900
But I'm different

351
00:18:21,900 --> 00:18:22,740
Different?

352
00:18:23,500 --> 00:18:24,200
That's right

353
00:18:24,200 --> 00:18:27,280
I trained my butt off to make up for not having any magic

354
00:18:27,280 --> 00:18:29,080
And people still treated me like crap

355
00:18:29,080 --> 00:18:31,100
I've spent my whole life being made fun of too

356
00:18:31,100 --> 00:18:32,960
But I never hated anybody for it

357
00:18:32,960 --> 00:18:34,440
It's true

358
00:18:34,440 --> 00:18:37,680
I was able to use the Devil's anti-magic because I had that grimoire

359
00:18:37,680 --> 00:18:40,880
But I never once thought about using it to get revenge on the Clover Kingdom

360
00:18:40,880 --> 00:18:43,320
Or to punish any of the people who treated me badly

361
00:18:43,320 --> 00:18:45,160
I only used it to help

362
00:18:45,160 --> 00:18:47,320
Whether they're rich or poor

363
00:18:47,320 --> 00:18:49,000
Royalty or commoner

364
00:18:49,000 --> 00:18:51,380
I just want everybody to be happy

365
00:18:51,380 --> 00:18:57,040
I can only imagine how happy we could have been if we looked at the world the way you do

366
00:18:57,040 --> 00:18:58,260
Indeed

367
00:18:58,260 --> 00:19:02,700
However, the flames of our hatred cannot be quenched

368
00:19:02,700 --> 00:19:05,760
Which is why we won't be releasing your friend

369
00:19:05,760 --> 00:19:08,000
We'll continue our journey towards Spade

370
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:09,700
Sure, whatever

371
00:19:09,700 --> 00:19:11,560
But Nero's staying right here

372
00:19:11,560 --> 00:19:13,220
Did you not hear me?

373
00:19:13,540 --> 00:19:14,820
Then let me go instead

374
00:19:14,820 --> 00:19:16,660
Oh no

375
00:19:16,660 --> 00:19:20,460
Wouldn't it be better to have me too, not just my grimoire?

376
00:19:20,660 --> 00:19:23,120
You went after both of us the first time you showed up

377
00:19:23,120 --> 00:19:25,160
So obviously I was part of your plan

378
00:19:25,160 --> 00:19:28,540
Fine, but we'll have to restrain you

379
00:19:28,540 --> 00:19:29,500
Of course

380
00:19:29,500 --> 00:19:30,500
And her too

381
00:19:30,500 --> 00:19:30,880
What?

382
00:19:40,680 --> 00:19:42,980
Now let Nero go like you promised

383
00:19:42,980 --> 00:19:44,620
We'll be glad to do that

384
00:19:44,620 --> 00:19:47,980
After we safely deliver you to the Spade Kingdom

385
00:19:47,980 --> 00:19:50,160
You just made a mistake

386
00:19:50,160 --> 00:19:51,420
Nah, don't worry

387
00:19:51,420 --> 00:19:52,680
I have faith in them

388
00:19:52,680 --> 00:19:56,660
We'll do whatever it takes to win the Devil's favor

389
00:19:56,660 --> 00:19:58,920
And the more gifts we can offer

390
00:19:58,920 --> 00:20:00,480
The better our chances

391
00:20:00,480 --> 00:20:02,160
Asta and his grimoire

392
00:20:02,160 --> 00:20:04,460
The girl who used forbidden magic

393
00:20:04,460 --> 00:20:06,860
And a royal as well

394
00:20:06,860 --> 00:20:09,000
I think they'll be pleased with this

395
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:11,400
That's if we get through the strong magic region

396
00:20:11,400 --> 00:20:13,320
Yes, of course

397
00:20:13,320 --> 00:20:16,000
Now let's proceed

398
00:20:16,000 --> 00:20:25,720
We're at the border

399
00:20:25,720 --> 00:20:30,360
Almost there

400
00:20:30,360 --> 00:20:33,620
Get ready

401
00:20:33,620 --> 00:20:39,220
I can feel it

402
00:20:39,220 --> 00:20:40,660
Full moon or not

403
00:20:40,660 --> 00:20:41,740
The mana's so strong

404
00:20:41,740 --> 00:20:42,540
It's overwhelming

405
00:20:42,540 --> 00:20:44,960
How do you plan to do this?

406
00:20:45,960 --> 00:20:46,540
As you know

407
00:20:46,540 --> 00:20:47,600
Our magic capability

408
00:20:47,600 --> 00:20:49,380
Is basically non-existent

409
00:20:49,380 --> 00:20:51,980
But not entirely

410
00:20:51,980 --> 00:20:54,540
We do possess a small amount of mana

411
00:20:54,540 --> 00:20:58,140
Using my catalyst magic

412
00:20:58,140 --> 00:21:00,320
I can gather the scraps of mana

413
00:21:00,320 --> 00:21:01,240
We each possess

414
00:21:01,240 --> 00:21:03,120
And combine them into something great

415
00:21:03,120 --> 00:21:06,060
Just as even the tiniest drops of water

416
00:21:06,060 --> 00:21:08,320
Can become an unstoppable current

417
00:21:08,320 --> 00:21:10,000
Dasu's catalyst magic

418
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:11,700
Will draw all of our strength together

419
00:21:11,700 --> 00:21:13,480
And then we can use that power

420
00:21:13,480 --> 00:21:15,360
To survive the strong magic region

421
00:21:15,360 --> 00:21:16,480
That's crazy

422
00:21:16,480 --> 00:21:17,460
Maybe

423
00:21:17,460 --> 00:21:19,400
But it's our best shot

424
00:21:19,400 --> 00:21:21,160
There's too much distance to cover

425
00:21:21,160 --> 00:21:22,720
And no way to be sure

426
00:21:22,720 --> 00:21:23,900
That your mana will hold out

427
00:21:23,900 --> 00:21:24,720
Until we get there

428
00:21:24,720 --> 00:21:26,200
This won't work

429
00:21:26,200 --> 00:21:28,380
I understand it's a gamble

430
00:21:28,380 --> 00:21:30,680
But at least one of us might make it

431
00:21:30,680 --> 00:21:32,020
And perhaps that person

432
00:21:32,020 --> 00:21:33,220
Will obtain the devil's power

433
00:21:33,220 --> 00:21:35,100
There's no turning back

434
00:21:35,100 --> 00:21:37,420
We must see this plan through to the end

435
00:21:37,420 --> 00:21:38,840
Or we won't get revenge

436
00:21:38,840 --> 00:21:40,020
On the Clover Kingdom

437
00:21:40,020 --> 00:21:41,460
You can't

438
00:21:41,460 --> 00:21:44,160
Let's proceed

439
00:21:44,160 --> 00:21:44,640
Yes

440
00:21:44,640 --> 00:21:47,660
What's that?

441
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:51,680
Sorry to keep you waiting

442
00:21:51,680 --> 00:21:53,660
The cavalry's here

443
00:21:53,660 --> 00:21:55,820
Magna

444
00:21:55,820 --> 00:21:57,120
Captain Yami

445
00:21:57,120 --> 00:22:27,100
I don't know.

446
00:22:27,120 --> 00:22:57,100
I don't know.

447
00:22:57,120 --> 00:23:27,100
I don't know.

448
00:23:27,120 --> 00:23:57,100
I don't know.

